  "label": "monkeys behind chain-link fence",
  "description": "Two monkeys are positioned behind a chain-link fence, looking directly at the viewer. The monkey on the left (monkey_1) has a lighter, almost bald head and a more human-like facial expression, while the monkey on the right has a fuller head of fur and is partially obscured by the fence wires. Both monkeys are visually connected by the fence structure, which creates a barrier between them and the viewer. The scene is framed by the fence, emphasizing their confinement and the visual metaphor of restraint.",
